7,77],"###The Solution#{3}":[78,78],"###The Solution#{4}":[79,80],"###The Solution#{5}":[81,81],"###The Solution#{6}":[82,82],"###The Solution#{7}":[83,83],"###The Solution#{8}":[84,85],"###Step 1:":[86,93],"###Step 1:#{1}":[88,93],"###Step 2:":[94,109],"###Step 2:#{1}":[96,109],"###Step 3:":[110,125],"###Step 3:#{1}":[112,125],"###Step 4:":[126,157],"###Step 4:#{1}":[128,157],"###Step 5:":[158,179],"###Step 5:#{1}":[160,179],"###Step 6:":[180,230],"###Step 6:#{1}":[182,230],"###Conclusion":[231,251],"###Conclusion#{1}":[233,251],"##[Microsoft Power BI Masterclass | Linktree](https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/linktree?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=linktree-medium-post-end&source=post_page-----f409b3679559---------------------------------------)":[252,264],"##[Microsoft Power BI Masterclass | Linktree](https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/linktree?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=linktree-medium-post-end&source=post_page-----f409b3679559---------------------------------------)#Let’s share our Microsoft Power BI experience. Learn together. Grow together.":[254,264],"##[Microsoft Power BI Masterclass | Linktree](https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/linktree?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=linktree-medium-post-end&source=post_page-----f409b3679559---------------------------------------)#Let’s share our Microsoft Power BI experience. Learn together. Grow together.#{1}":[256,264]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Md Mizanur Rahman Nayan","target":"Md Mizanur Rahman Nayan","line":5},{"title":"Monthly Data Drill","target":"https://mavenanalytics.io/data-drills/streak-leaderboard?utm_source=linkedin&utm_campaign=datadrill_streakleaderboard_li_maven","line":13},{"title":"This image shows a table of lesson activity for one user, Bobby Fairways. It lists lesson IDs and dates, highlighting two streaks of consecutive learning: a 3-day streak from September 10–12 and a 4-day active streak from September 25–28. A gap between these dates marks a break in the streak. The annotations help visualize user engagement and identify patterns in consistent learning behavior.","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*2O0kDiEkSSwh2EbkNRfSCg.png","line":17,"embedded":true},{"title":"**Get friend links for all of our 1000> Power BI learning articles here**","target":"https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/learning-database?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=database-medium-post-start","line":23},{"title":"This image shows a table tracking a user’s daily activity over time. Each row includes a user ID, date, rank, and a calculated “island” value. The island column reflects the start of a streak by subtracting the rank from the date, helping identify clusters of consecutive activity. Gaps between dates signal breaks in engagement, making it easier to spot streaks and isolate patterns.","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*-WAnY6z0K5ptQwrPMIMKUg.png","line":154,"embedded":true},{"title":"This image shows a table tracking user activity streaks. Each row includes a user ID, a date, and a streak length, indicating how many consecutive days the user was active. The data reveals patterns of engagement, with some users showing longer streaks and others appearing sporadically. This helps identify consistent behavior and gaps in participation over time.","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*HynLaRxwcfxtPUkdNbtjqg.png","line":174,"embedded":true},{"title":"Md Mizanur Rahman Nayan","target":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mizan2390","line":237},{"title":"Follow","target":"https://medium.com/@mdrahmanmizan","line":240},{"title":"Subscribe","target":"https://medium.com/@mdrahmanmizan/subscribe","line":240},{"title":"**Get friend links for all of our 1000> Power BI learning articles here**","target":"https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/learning-database?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=database-medium-post-start","line":242},{"title":"Power BI Publication","target":"https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/publication?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=publication-medium-post-end","line":246},{"title":"Power BI Newsletter","target":"https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/newsletter-medium?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=newsletter-medium-medium-post-end","line":248},{"title":"Microsoft Power BI Masterclass | Linktree","target":"https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/linktree?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=linktree-medium-post-end&source=post_page-----f409b3679559---------------------------------------","line":252}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[90,92],[98,108],[114,124],[130,153],[162,173],[184,186],[190,229]],"key":"99.System/InboxArchive/2026-08/Gaps and Islands Solving Consecutive Active Days in Power BI.md"},
